# ==============================================================================
# Particle emitters - the braziers. Signature:
#   ParticleEmitter <type> x y z rate life speed spread sizeStart sizeEnd
#     r g b rEnd gEnd bEnd gravity radius dirX dirY dirZ yaw
# (Z-up here, like every other entity line.)
# ==============================================================================
ParticleEmitter fire 49 -9 1.6 34 0.9 3.2 12 0.35 0.05 255 175 70 255 60 0 -2 6 0 0 1 0
ParticleEmitter fire 69 -9 1.6 34 0.9 3.2 12 0.35 0.05 255 175 70 255 60 0 -2 6 0 0 1 0
ParticleEmitter fire 49 9 1.6 34 0.9 3.2 12 0.35 0.05 255 175 70 255 60 0 -2 6 0 0 1 0
ParticleEmitter fire 69 9 1.6 34 0.9 3.2 12 0.35 0.05 255 175 70 255 60 0 -2 6 0 0 1 0

# ==============================================================================
# Wind zone over the arena. Bounds are Z-up like every other entity; dirX/dirY
# are horizontal and dirZ is up. Only `wind=1` meshes react, which is what the
# borrowed bushes above are for.
# ==============================================================================
WindZone 42 -26 0 76 26 12 1 0 0.3 7 0.5

# ==============================================================================
# Lights. effect 2 = TORCH, 1 = WATERY, 3 = FIRE, 4 = LAMP.
# Interior lights are placed OFF the column axes and above/below the crates so
# worldcheck does not report them buried inside a solid, where they would light
# nothing (the columns sit exactly at each room's centre).
# ==============================================================================
# Overcast daylight. A directional light's position is the SOURCE, aimed at the
# world origin, so a large +z is an overhead sun.
light directional -50 -50 70 205 215 235 0.30
light directional 50 50 40 140 155 180 0.12

# Chamber lights, colour-coded to the pickups
light point -4 14 5.5 255 60 60 0.45 22
light point 16 14 5.5 80 130 255 0.45 22
light point 16 -14 5.5 255 170 50 0.45 22
light point -4 -14 5.5 255 220 60 0.45 22
# Great Hall: cool strips under the ceiling slabs + a warm dais lamp
light point 14 -30 5.5 200 215 255 0.38 20
light point 28 -44 5.5 200 215 255 0.38 20
light point 16 -38 4.5 255 225 190 0.45 16
# Corridors
light point 20 -22 5 190 205 255 0.45 16
light point 10 0 5 190 205 255 0.4 14
# East corridor to the arena
light point 34 0 5.5 190 210 255 0.5 18
# Courtyard braziers (TORCH, not WATERY) - offset off the pillar axes
light point 16 -60 4.5 255 180 80 0.6 18 2
light point 24 -60 4.5 255 180 80 0.6 18 2
light point 16 -68 4.5 255 180 80 0.5 16 2
light point 24 -68 4.5 255 180 80 0.5 16 2
light point 20 -66 2 120 200 255 0.4 22
# Arena: brazier torches + a cool wash over the pyramid + the watchtower
light point 49 -9 2.4 255 165 75 0.75 16 2
light point 69 -9 2.4 255 165 75 0.75 16 2
light point 49 9 2.4 255 165 75 0.75 16 2
light point 69 9 2.4 255 165 75 0.75 16 2
light point 59 0 9 190 210 255 0.5 34
light point 74 22 10.5 120 200 255 0.5 16

